msgid ""
"One of the lines belongs to a debit/credit note of IGTF or of the exchange "
"difference. Such notes are reconciled from their own document to keep the "
"date and rate of the payment."
msgstr ""
"Una de las líneas pertenece a una nota de débito/crédito de IGTF o del "
"diferencial cambiario. Esas notas se concilian desde su propio documento "
"para conservar la fecha y la tasa del pago."

#. module: l10n_ve_reconcile_assistant
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_ve_reconcile_assistant/models/account_move_line.py:0
msgid ""
"One of the lines belongs to an advance cross entry. Crosses are reconciled "
"and undone from the invoice, since doing it here would break the link with "
"the origin payment."
msgstr ""
"Una de las líneas pertenece a un asiento de cruce de anticipo. Los cruces se"
" concilian y se deshacen desde la factura, ya que hacerlo aquí rompería el "
"vínculo con el pago origen."

